# Actuation's menu contribution (#190): the Actuate rows — the ladder's second rung, and the
# first NEW kind of move to arrive as a package's own branch (#207 built the mechanism with
# this row as its recorded first customer).
#
# The premise walks BOTH chains, and both must end at $me:
#   the LEVER chain — an actuator I hold, plumbed to my own subject; and
#   the RESOURCE chain — the lever draws from a source that is MINE (market:offeredBy $me,
#   arriving entailed through the domain's word) AND that no market offers as its lot.
# The second guard is the rule that keeps the rung honest: the market is about the resource,
# not the lever. A pot-local pump on the shared barrel is a lever I own on a resource I do
# not, and opening it without a claim would take from the commons without bidding — so that
# pump yields Acquire and only Acquire, and this row appears exactly where nothing anyone
# else owns is touched. "A source no market offers" was the ladder record's open seam; the
# NOT EXISTS below is that walk, derived at last — it sees hand-authored venues and derived
# ones alike, because a menu query reads the whole default graph.
#
# The direction is the domain's stated atom, reached through the source's good exactly as the
# market's branch reaches it: one physics sentence, whichever rung applies it.
#
# `$me` substituted by the collector; declares no prefixes of its own — `store.query`
# prepends them.

SELECT ?means ?property ?via ?direction ?mode WHERE {
  # An agent holds TWO shapes per property — the region it wants to be in and the survival
  # envelope it must not leave — and both carry `ssn:forProperty`, so matching on that alone
  # offered every lever twice. The severity is what tells them apart, and it is also the right
  # question: a lever is worth listing because there is something the agent WANTS about that
  # property, not because the property has an edge past which its subject dies.
  $me ag:holds ?region ; ag:actsFor ?subject .
  ?region ssn:forProperty ?property ;
          sh:property/sh:severity ag:ShouldBecome .
  $me actuation:hasActuator ?via .
  ?via actuation:actuates ?subject ;
       actuation:drawsFrom ?source .
  ?source market:offeredBy $me .
  FILTER NOT EXISTS { ?venue market:marketFor ?source }
  ?source market:supplies ?good .
  ?valuation market:ofGood ?good ;
             market:aboutProperty ?property ;
             market:direction ?direction .
  BIND(ag:Actuate AS ?means)
  BIND(deliberation:Chosen AS ?mode)
}
